<title>ESTONIA: TALLINNA PANK SIGNS EBRD LOAN.</title>
<headline>TALLINNA PANK SIGNS EBRD LOAN.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Pank said on Tuesday that it has signed a five million mark subordinated loan with the European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD).</p>
</text>
